# Local maps go live

`public/data/levels/*.json` is part of the game. When committing or pushing to live, include every local map change (modified and new). Do not leave level JSON unstaged.

Live deploy: `git push origin HEAD`, `npm run build`, rsync `dist/` to Pressable `htdocs/warchess/`, purge edge cache on site 1739399 (fictionindustries-oneshots).
